{
  "name": "Convert new PDFs in Google Drive to Markdown with Parsebridge",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "2c0aae8c-8908-4a0b-b2cc-e5fc316038ae",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -600,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Convert new PDFs in Google Drive to Markdown\n\nEvery PDF added to a Google Drive folder is converted to Markdown with Parsebridge (hosted Docling) and saved as a `.md` file in a second folder. Tables become Markdown tables, headings stay headings, and scanned pages get OCR. Useful for search, documentation, or feeding PDFs to LLMs and RAG pipelines.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Google Drive Trigger** checks a folder every minute for new files.\n2. **Download file** fetches the new file.\n3. **Is PDF?** skips anything that isn't a PDF.\n4. **Parse PDF to Markdown** sends the PDF to Parsebridge; the Markdown is in `content`.\n5. **Markdown to file** creates a `.md` file named like the PDF.\n6. **Upload Markdown** saves it to your output folder.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect a Google Drive OAuth2 credential on the three Google Drive nodes.\n2. Create an API key at https://dash.parsebridge.com (50 free pages on signup, no credit card) and add it as a Parsebridge API credential.\n3. Pick the folder to watch in **Google Drive Trigger** and the output folder in **Upload Markdown**.\n4. Activate the workflow and drop a PDF into the watched folder.\n\n### Customizing\n- Send `content` to an LLM, a vector store, Notion or Slack instead of saving a file.\n- Swap the trigger for Gmail attachments or a webhook.\n\nEach PDF page uses one Parsebridge credit. PDFs up to 50 MB."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a881508c-74ec-4797-a074-11b8660e1ffe",
      "name": "Google Drive Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDriveTrigger",
      "position": [
        -60,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "event": "fileCreated",
        "options": {},
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "triggerOn": "specificFolder",
        "folderToWatch": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "",
          "cachedResultName": ""
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7d90e92e-acd1-4c0c-a1fd-221cec704fd1",
      "name": "Download file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "position": [
        160,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fileId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "download"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "d5673bc1-6293-404f-abf9-1d6cdaf41274",
      "name": "Is PDF?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        380,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $binary.data.mimeType }}",
              "value2": "application/pdf"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9770a108-70d6-4e2b-9582-f4e849c93d78",
      "name": "Parse PDF to Markdown",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-parsebridge.parsebridge",
      "position": [
        600,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "parseFile",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0349b7f6-19c7-4603-bd99-3958a6e4d732",
      "name": "Markdown to file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "position": [
        820,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
